WEBVTT

00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:31.962
možete snimiti zločin protiv čovječnosti u Syrii.

00:00:31.962 --> 00:00:33.914
Sa mobitelom,

00:00:33.914 --> 00:00:36.202
možete tweetati poruku

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:42.045
i započeti prosvjed u Egiptu.

00:00:42.045 --> 00:00:44.522
I sa mobitelom,

00:00:44.522 --> 00:00:47.443
možete snimiti pjesmu, uploadati ju

00:00:47.443 --> 00:00:49.924
na SoundCloud i postati poznati.

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:54.494
Sve ovo je moguće s vašim mobitelom.

00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:56.543
Rođen sam 1984.,

00:00:56.543 --> 00:00:59.904
i živim u gradu Berlinu.

00:00:59.904 --> 00:01:05.584
Vratimo se u to vrijeme, u ovaj grad.